NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000230 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000231 "Please report any bugs or feature requests on the bugtracker website L<https://rt.cpan.org/Public/Dist/Display.html?Name=Perinci-Sub-ConvertArgs-Argv>"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000232 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000233 "When submitting a bug or request, please include a test-file or a"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000234 "patch to an existing test-file that illustrates the bug or desired"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000235 "feature."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000236 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000237 "=head1 SEE ALSO"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000238 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000239 "L<Perinci::CmdLine>, which uses this module for presenting command-line"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000240 "examples."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000241 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000242 "L<Perinci::Sub::GetArgs::Argv> which does the reverse: converting command-line"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00000243 "arguments to hash."
